  "updated_at": "2026-03-28",
  "bio": "Arxv Tattooer is a highly skilled illustrator-tattoo artist based in Webster, United States, who is much sought after for their intricate and vividly expressive designs. Clients appreciate the cleanliness of Arxv's studio, where every session is characterized by a scrupulous attention to hygiene and safety, ensuring a comfortable and reassuring experience. Whether it's a whimsical piece or a complex narrative tattoo, fans of the illustrative style will find Arxv's meticulous approach to cleanliness and craftsmanship exceptional.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Webster, Texas, United States",
